WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:03.800
Did you always want to go to LSU?

2
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:04.380
Yeah.

3
00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:09.760
Yeah, I . . . Because my mother had gone to school down there and I used to follow the LSU football team.

4
00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:12.020
I used to listen to Billy Cannon, you know,

5
00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:19.620
when he was in . . . LSU had a national championship and the Chinese Bandits and the Gold Team and the White Team,

6
00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:21.700
and I used to follow that by radio.

7
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:23.040
I mean, that was the only way I could ever listen to it.

8
00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:31.340
The games on the radio and they would be on the news on television, and I really got excited about LSU through those things.
